# Context for infra/docker/python.Dockerfile (built from the repo root). Only the
# Python workspace goes in: no secrets, local envs, caches or desktop app.

# Secrets and local environments
.env
.env.*
**/.venv
**/node_modules

# VCS, editor and tooling state
.git
.github
.claude
.vscode
.idea

# Caches and build output
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
**/*.egg-info
**/dist
**/build
**/*.log
**/celerybeat-schedule*

# Not part of any image
**/tests
apps/desktop
infra/*
!infra/docker
# Root-level docs only; agent skills/*.md ship in the wheels.
*.md
